    "text": "Think of a variable as one named place that holds the value.\nInstead of remembering where every 50 is.\n\nint coffeePrice = 45;\nprintf(\"Coffee - %d EGP\\n\", coffeePrice);\n\nChanging coffeePrice updates the output.",
