# ============================================================
# 4) CHOICES
# ============================================================
# The written Chapter One scenario is primarily linear and does
# not define explicit branching choices. The following choices
# represent admin-authored optional dialogue decisions that fit
# the existing scenes.
#
# IMPORTANT:
# CreateStoryBeat automatically creates the Consequence record
# for a BeatType=Consequence beat, but BeatDto does NOT expose
# ConsequenceId. Therefore the current API cannot automatically
# wire a newly-created consequence beat into CreateChoiceDto.
#
# For that reason, the choice requests below intentionally use
# ConsequenceId = null. After you expose the ConsequenceId through
# an admin DTO/endpoint, replace null with the generated IDs.


### Choice — Father conversation: push back
# Optional branch derived from the Prologue.
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/choices
# Content-Type: application/json

# [
#   {
#     "beatId": 0,
#     "choiceIndex": 1,
#     "choiceText": "Great system. Very motivating.",
#     "tier": "Acceptable",
#     "consequenceId": null,
#     "immediateFeedback": "Mohamed pushes back with sarcasm."
#   }
# ]

###

